	"Name": "Alternate Sheep Colors",
	"Author": "DarkKassanova",
	"Description": "This mod changes your sheep&#39;s colors&#33; It also changes the color of the wool you get from shearing and the wool when you put it on the loom&#33;\r<br />If you have any color suggestions, feel free to leave a comment&#33;\r<br />\r<br />[b][u]To Install:\r<br />[/u][/b]1. Backup your BabySheep.xnb , ShearedSheep.xnb , and Sheep.xnb located at\u00A0Steam&#92;steamapps&#92;common&#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Content&#92;Animals\r<br />2. Backup your springobjects.xnb located at\u00A0Steam&#92;steamapps&#92;common&#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Content&#92;Maps\r<br />3. Download whichever color you want (or all colors&#33;)\r<br />4. Extract the .rar and put the new .xnb files where your old ones were (at the locations above)\r<br />5. Start up Stardew Valley and see your pretty sheep&#33;\r<br />\r<br />[u]My other animal mods:[/u]\r<br />[url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/195/?]Zombie Cows[/url]\r<br />[url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/186/?]Alternate Dino Colors[/url]\u00A0\r<br />[url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/189/?]Alternate Chicken Colors[/url]",
